  "summary": "TROX UNIVERSAL lab and room airflow controllers connect to BACnet IP through the EM-IP expansion module. This is TROX's EDE file for the all TROX UNIVERSAL applications (combined list) (order code TU*): 133 value objects (68 AV, 52 BV, 13 MV). The module always carries the objects of every application; each application's EDE lists only the ones it fills.",
